rds\n ","tree_line_end":85,"tree_line_start":77},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"Capital Disregards\n ","tree_line_end":85,"tree_line_start":81},{"depth":4,"role":"TD","text":"3\n ","tree_line_end":94,"tree_line_start":86},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"3\n ","tree_line_end":94,"tree_line_start":90},{"depth":3,"role":"TR","text":"Definitions\n \n4\n ","tree_line_end":114,"tree_line_start":95},{"depth":4,"role":"TD","text":"Definitions\n ","tree_line_end":105,"tree_line_start":97},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"Definitions\n ","tree_line_end":105,"tree_line_start":101},{"depth":4,"role":"TD","text":"4\n ","tree_line_end":114,"tree_line_start":106},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"4\n ","tree_line_end":114,"tree_line_start":110},{"depth":3,"role":"TR","text":"Employment and Support Allowance\n \n5\n ","tree_line_end":134,"tree_line_start":115},{"depth":4,"role":"TD","text":"Employment and Support Allowance\n ","tree_line_end":125,"tree_line_start":117},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"Employment and Support Allowance\n ","tree_line_end":125,"tree_line_start":121},{"depth":4,"role":"TD","text":"5\n ","tree_line_end":134,"tree_line_start":126},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"5\n ","tree_line_end":134,"tree_line_start":130},{"depth":3,"role":"TR","text":"Social Fund Funeral Payment\n \n6\n ","tree_line_end":154,"tree_line_start":135},{"depth":4,"role":"TD","text":"Social Fund Funeral Payment\n ","tree_line_end":145,"tree_line_start":137},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"Social Fund Funeral Payment\n ","tree_line_end":145,"tree_line_start":141},{"depth":4,"role":"TD","text":"6\n ","tree_line_end":154,"tree_line_start":146},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"6\n ","tree_line_end":154,"tree_line_start":150},{"depth":3,"role":"TR","text":"Universal Credit (Transitional \nProtections)\n \n7\n ","tree_line_end":175,"tree_line_start":155},{"depth":4,"role":"TD","text":"Universal Credit (Transitional \nProtections)\n ","tree_line_end":166,"tree_line_start":157},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"Universal Credit (Transitional \nProtections)\n ","tree_line_end":166,"tree_line_start":161},{"depth":4,"role":"TD","text":"7\n ","tree_line_end":175,"tree_line_start":167},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"7\n ","tree_line_end":175,"tree_line_start":171},{"depth":3,"role":"TR","text":"Annotations\n \n ","tree_line_end":194,"tree_line_start":176},{"depth":4,"role":"TD","text":"Annotations\n ","tree_line_end":186,"tree_line_start":178},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"Annotations\n ","tree_line_end":186,"tree_line_start":182},{"depth":4,"role":"TD","text":" ","tree_line_end":194,"tree_line_start":187},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":194,"tree_line_start":191},{"depth":3,"role":"TR","text":"Contacts\n \n ","tree_line_end":213,"tree_line_start":195},{"depth":4,"role":"TD","text":"Contacts\n ","tree_line_end":205,"tree_line_start":197},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"Contacts\n ","tree_line_end":205,"tree_line_start":201},{"depth":4,"role":"TD","text":" ","tree_line_end":213,"tree_line_start":206},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":213,"tree_line_start":210},{"depth":2,"role":"H3","text":" ","tree_line_end":217,"tree_line_start":214},{"depth":2,"role":"H3","text":"Introduction\n ","tree_line_end":223,"tree_line_start":218},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"1.\n \nThis memo gives guidance on The Social Security (Scotland) Act 2018 (Carer’s Assistance) \n(Consequential Modifications) Order 2026\n1\n which came into force on 15.03.26.\n ","tree_line_end":236,"tree_line_start":224},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"1 \nSI 2026 (link is external)\n ","tree_line_end":247,"tree_line_start":237},{"depth":2,"role":"H3","text":"Background\n ","tree_line_end":253,"tree_line_start":248},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"2.\n This order\n1\n makes changes to social security legislation to reflect additional elements to \nScottish\n \nCarer’s\n \nAssistance, such as extending the run-on period for which a carer will receive \nScottish\n \ncarer support after the death of their cared-for person, from the current eight weeks to a period \nof twelve weeks, as well a change in definition for\n \n“carer support payment”.\n ","tree_line_end":275,"tree_line_start":254},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":" \n1 \nSI 2026 (link is external)\n ","tree_line_end":287,"tree_line_start":276},{"depth":2,"role":"H3","text":"Capital Disregards\n ","tree_line_end":292,"tree_line_start":288},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"3.\n \nWhen considering whether a claimant has any applicable capital disregards,\n ","tree_line_end":300,"tree_line_start":293},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"1.\n Scottish carer supplement\n ","tree_line_end":308,"tree_line_start":301},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"2.\n carer\n \nadditional\n \nperson payment\n ","tree_line_end":320,"tree_line_start":309},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"3.\n any amount of the carer support payment\n \ncomponent\n \nin excess of\n \nthe amount the claimant \nwould receive if they had an entitlement to CA.\n ","tree_line_end":335,"tree_line_start":321},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"are social security benefits which are not included as unearned income\n1\n.\n \n ","tree_line_end":345,"tree_line_start":336},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"1\n \nUC Regs, Sch 10, para 18(2)\n ","tree_line_end":357,"tree_line_start":346},{"depth":2,"role":"H3","text":"Definitions\n ","tree_line_end":363,"tree_line_start":358},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"4.\n Within the\n \nUC\n1\n, JSA\n2\n \n \nand ESA\n3\n \nregulations where \"carer support payment\" is defined, \"carers \nassistance\" is substituted by the carer support payment component of carer support\".","tree_line_end":387,"tree_line_start":364},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"1\n \nUC Regs  \n   \n13,  \n   \nPart 1,  \n   \nReg 2  \n ","tree_line_end":414,"tree_line_start":388},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"2\n \nJSA Regs  \n   \n13,  \n   \nPart 1, Reg  \n   \n2  \n ","tree_line_end":441,"tree_line_start":415},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"3\n \nESA Regs  \n   \n13, Part 1, Reg 2  \n ","tree_line_end":458,"tree_line_start":442},{"depth":2,"role":"H3","text":"Employment and Support Allowance\n ","tree_line_end":464,"tree_line_start":459},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"5.\n \nWithin the ESA\n \nRegulations\n1\n “carer\n \nsupport\n \npayment”\n \nis\n \nsubstituted by\n \n“carer support given in \naccordance with the\n \nCarer’s\n \nAssistance”\n \n(Carer Support Payment) (Scotland) Regulations 2023”,\n \nwhen \ncalculating a claimant’s income where ESA entitlement is for less than a week.\n ","tree_line_end":498,"tree_line_start":465},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"1\n \nESA Regs 2013, Part 13, Reg 100(b)\n ","tree_line_end":510,"tree_line_start":499},{"depth":2,"role":"H3","text":"Social Fund Funeral Payment\n ","tree_line_end":516,"tree_line_start":511},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"6.\n \nWithin the Social Fund\n \nFuneral Payment Regulations\n1\n,\n \n“carer\n \nsupport\n \npayment”\n \nis substituted \nby\n \n“carer support”\n \nwithin\n \nthe list of benefits\n \nwhich\n \narrears\n \nare not\n \ncounted as assets\n \nwhen considering \ndeductions\n \nto the amount\n \nof award of funeral payment.\n ","tree_line_end":560,"tree_line_start":517},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"1\n \n ","tree_line_end":571,"tree_line_start":561},{"depth":2,"role":"H3","text":"Universal Credit\n \n(Transitional Protections)\n ","tree_line_end":580,"tree_line_start":572},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"7.\n \nWithin the UC\n \n(TP)\n \nRegulations\n1\n,\n \n“carers assistance” is substituted by “the carer support payment \ncomponent of carer support”\n \nwithin\n \nthe list of benefits\n \nwhere,\n \nif in receipt,\n \nthe claimant can be \nconsidered a\n \ncarer.\n ","tree_line_end":612,"tree_line_start":581},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"1\n \nUC (TP) Regs 2014, Sch 2,  \n   \npara 8(2)  \n ","tree_line_end":629,"tree_line_start":613},{"depth":2,"role":"H3","text":"Annotations\n ","tree_line_end":635,"tree_line_start":630},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"The number of this memo should be annotated against the following ADM paragraphs;\n \nADM Memo \n23\n,\n \nH2152\n,\n \nU1085\n, \nU1303\n,\n \nM6764\n,\n \nR1027\n, \nR2702,\n \nR2252\n,\n \nADM L3408\n,\n \nAppendix 1 to ADM Chapter \nL3\n,\n \nV1324\n.\n ","tree_line_end":711,"tree_line_start":636},{"depth":2,"role":"H3","text":"Contacts\n ","tree_line_end":717,"tree_line_start":712},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"If you have any queries about this memo, please write to Decision Making and Appeals (DMA) Leeds, 3E \nzone E, Quarry House, Leeds. Existing arrangements for such referrals should be followed, as set out in –\nMemo\n \n4/19\n \nRequesting case guidance from DMA Leeds for all benefits.\n ","tree_line_end":731,"tree_line_start":718},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"DMA Leeds: March 2026","tree_line_end":737,"tree_line_start":732},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":741,"tree_line_start":738},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":745,"tree_line_start":742},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":749,"tree_line_start":746},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":753,"tree_line_start":750},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":757,"tree_line_start":754},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":761,"tree_line_start":758}],"bounds":{"stderr_bytes":65536,"stdout_bytes":16777216,"timeout_seconds":45},"command":["/opt/homebrew/bin/pdfinfo","-struct-text","source/adm-2026-09-19/pdf/adm-memo-02-26.pdf"],"diagnostics":{"roles_not_emitted":{"Document":1,"Link":31,"Sect":1,"Span":39},"text_joiner":"\n","tree_lines":761,"unparsed_line_count":31,"unparsed_line_samples":[{"text":"        Object 404 0","tree_line":246},{"text":"        Object 401 0","tree_line":286},{"text":"        Object 398 0","tree_line":356},{"text":"        Object 389 0","tree_line":398},{"text":"        Object 389 0","tree_line":403},{"text":"        Object 389 0","tree_line":408},{"text":"        Object 389 0","tree_line":413},{"text":"        Object